{"id":"624756","name":"面条菜鸡蛋木耳素饺","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624756/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面条菜","amount":"80g"},{"name":"柴鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"80g"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"水","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"g面粉。","img":"images/624756/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"g清水和面，先搅成絮状。","img":"images/624756/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用手揉成稍硬点的面团，放那饧着。","img":"images/624756/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"面条菜择洗净。","img":"images/624756/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"泡发的木耳。","img":"images/624756/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"柴鸡蛋打散备用。","img":"images/624756/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里适量油烧温热，鸡蛋液倒入。","img":"images/624756/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用筷子不停搅动，炒成小粒，晾凉备用。","img":"images/624756/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"木耳切木耳碎。","img":"images/624756/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"面条菜切碎。","img":"images/624756/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"面条菜，木耳，鸡蛋放大碗里。","img":"images/624756/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"先淋上适量香油，适量盐，自己卤的花椒粉。","img":"images/624756/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒适量蚝油。","img":"images/624756/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"拌匀备用。","img":"images/624756/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"饧好的面，揉光团。","img":"images/624756/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"取一半的面搓成长条。","img":"images/624756/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"切成大小均匀的剂孑。","img":"images/624756/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"按扁。","img":"images/624756/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"擀成饺子皮。","img":"images/624756/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"取一张饺子皮，包上适量馅儿。","img":"images/624756/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"捏成饺子。","img":"images/624756/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"锅里适量水烧开，饺子放入锅里。","img":"images/624756/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"煮两三滚儿，即可。","img":"images/624756/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624756/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624756/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n